  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and cook until it's translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic and cook for another minute.",
    "Add the turmeric, cumin, paprika, and cayenne pepper, and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the zucchini and cook until it's tender, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the salt and black pepper.",
    "Stir in the buckwheat, and cook for 2-3 minutes, stirring constantly.",
    "Stir in the labneh or yogurt, and cook for another minute.",
    "Add the mustard seeds and stir to combine.",
    "Serve warm, garnished with chopped fresh herbs if desired.",
    "Adjust seasoning to taste.",
    "Serve immediately."
